        "slc_667455eef92c030773356b0e1acde7b9bc2f5d245801d5d80155e4951a7db75a"
      ],
      "text": "The kit exposes five stage-based commands: doctor (inspect without modifying), adopt (apply minimal harness pieces), review (challenge the diff pre-commit/PR), update (bring in a newer kit reference), and refresh (clean stale or duplicated guidance)."
    },
