        "slc_fae2bea288e8e6263bfdb0b581c08c6d9b3ceb5d638b77c01142f8205d44647e"
      ],
      "text": "The adoption prompt instructs the agent to treat the working directory as the target repo, treat the cloned kit as read-only reference, inspect before editing, preserve existing architecture and conventions, and add only minimal harness pieces."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_801686245ff566ef93f961a193ebc759f8c7e25be9e4a3a9417941926e7a01c6",
