          "line_end": 122,
          "line_start": 113,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "harnessworks/harness-starter-kit",
          "url": "https://github.com/harnessworks/harness-starter-kit/blob/62437bec264b2deed83353e8209660d645e86828/README.md#L113-L122"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_44dbe1cce56c397db4a311053dd90f722f709cdaec04168bb24078d3fc71b470"
      ],
      "text": "The expected adoption outcome includes a project-specific AGENTS.md, a knowledge store if none exists, lightweight drift checks from the repo's real rules, local verification commands, and an adoption report covering changes, checks, assumptions, failure memory, and gate placement."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
